pt if the text comments specifically indicated\"}, {\"loc\": \"ocr\", \"q\": \"National estimate might be unstable because it is based on <20 cases or the coefficient of variation is >30%\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}